37178>>>>>    
37178>>>>>    //
37178>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
37178>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
37178>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
37178>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
37178>>>>>    //
37178>>>>>    // Params:
37178>>>>>    //      bClear   True if the procedure is called before session validation to clear properties.
37178>>>>>    //
37178>>>>>    Procedure UpdateSessionProperties Boolean bClear
37180>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
37180>>>>>        
37180>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
37181>>>>>        
37181>>>>>        //  Update user properties
37181>>>>>        If (not(bClear) and HasRecord(hoUserDD)) Begin
37183>>>>>            Set psUsername to (Trim(WebAppUser.FullName))
37184>>>>>            Set psLoginName to (Trim(WebAppUser.LoginName))
37185>>>>>            Set piUserRights to WebAppUser.Rights
37186>>>>>            
37186>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesSet 
37187>>>>>        End
37187>>>>>>
37187>>>>>        Else Begin
37188>>>>>            Set psUsername to ""
37189>>>>>            Set psLoginName to ""
37190>>>>>            Set piUserRights to 0
37191>>>>>            
37191>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesClear
37192>>>>>        End
37192>>>>>>
37192>>>>>    End_Procedure
37193>>>>>    
37193>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesSet
37195>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37195>>>>>    End_Procedure
37196>>>>>    
37196>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesClear
37198>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37198>>>>>    End_Procedure
37199>>>>>    
37199>>>>>    Procedure EndSession
37201>>>>>        Integer iErr
37201>>>>>        Boolean bLogWebSession
37201>>>>>        Handle hoSessionDD       
37201>>>>>        
37201>>>>>        Get phoSessionDD to hoSessionDD
37202>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37203>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37205>>>>>            Forward Send EndSession
37207>>>>>            Procedure_Return
37208>>>>>        End
37208>>>>>>
37208>>>>>            
37208>>>>>        //  Check if session exists
37208>>>>>        Send Clear of hoSessionDD
37209>>>>>        Get psSessionKey to WebAppSession.SessionKey
37210>>>>>        
37210>>>>>        Send Find of hoSessionDD EQ Index.1
37211>>>>>        If (Found) Begin
37213>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoSessionDD Field WebAppSession.Active to "N"
37214>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoSessionDD to iErr
37215>>>>>            If (iErr) Begin
37217>>>>>                // this should not happen. If it does its a programming error
37217>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$WebAppSessionValidateFailed
37218>>>>>>
37218>>>>>                Procedure_Return
37219>>>>>            End
37219>>>>>>
37219>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoSessionDD
37220>>>>>        End
37220>>>>>>
37220>>>>>    End_Procedure
