38398>>>                Case Break
38399>>>
38399>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38399>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
38399>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
38399>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
38400>>>
